		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Frilled, legless, opalescent dragonkin, scales like intricate stained glass.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 35, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (1d8) or sedative breath or prismatic pattern, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Prismatic Pattern</strong>. Creatures who can see in double near WIS 15+ or dazed for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sedative Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) of sleep goo extending double near from scitalis. CON 15+ or fall sleep for 1d6 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
